    VENDOR ONLY (MISS-04f): the escrow PRIVATE key side of cloud backups - make an escrow key pair, open an escrow slot, issue a restore key.
    Referenced ONLY by tools/BackupEscrowRecovery (the offline tool) and its tests; never by the desktop, a module or a server.
    Like Security.Es256.Signing: only what .NET has built in.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Security.BackupEnvelope\Security.BackupEnvelope.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
